# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Original camera / source media
#
# Every folder below is the raw, uncompressed import for a gallery.
# The versions the site actually loads live beside them, already
# resized and re-encoded (assets/projects/fyp-semester1, sobel-fpga,
# flyme, ...). Keeping the originals out of git matters: GitHub
# refuses any single file over 100 MB, and git keeps every blob it
# has ever seen forever, so one accidental commit bloats the clone
# for good.
#
# The files stay on disk — they are simply not tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

assets/projects/FlyMe_RC plane/
